        "TileImage": "$($repository 8c364eb8-cde7-473e-9fa6-5b3a1c7da10e).Image",
        "Description": "This small group of agents on vacation are known as the kingslayers, they are known to leak data for cash.  Captain Rutherford is like jangus an ex KGB oprative.His  Goal is to buy data from the three agents on vacation, Your job is to elimanate them all before the meeting. Try to stay under the radar, Two of them are not very smart when it comes to not getting their food or drink laced just a small tip. Good luck agent, Happy Hunting.",
